                          className="px-4 py-4 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-gray-300 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl transition-all cursor-pointer"
                        >
                          🛒 Merch
                        </a>

                        {inTheaters ? (
